Package: rerddapUtils
Title: Miscellaneous Utilities for 'rerddap'.
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-04-16
Authors@R: person("Roy", "Mendelssohn", email = "roy.mendelssohn@noaa.gov", role = c("aut","cre"))
Description:  'rerddapUtils' is an `R` package that is a set of four main 
 functions designed to work with and extend the `rerddap` package
 which are better not being included in the `rerddap` package. This includes restricting by season,
 spltting large requests, and working with projected datasets. There are also two utility functions
 to estimate the size of an 'rerddap::griddap()' request.
